{"id":4599880,"shortDescription":"Una sim acogedora de gestión inmobiliaria donde restauras el edificio ruinoso que te dejó tu abuela. Encuentra inquilinos, cobra alquileres, mejóralo. Pero no se te ocurra poner a un elfo que hace solos de guitarra a medianoche al lado de un yeti filósofo. Pedidos sin fin y dulce caos te esperan.","developers":["Overbaked Studio"],"publishers":["PlayWay S.A."],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Controles de volumen personalizados","#category_playable_at_your_own_pace","Jugable sin restricciones de tiempo","Guardar en cualquier momento","Sonido estéreo","Steam Cloud","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"13 NOV 2026","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599880/c2ded6568630c104d573f83d98543a6ede5ce81b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1794866995","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599880/4da212ab29f5ced583938901804ed8a93665f51b/ss_4da212ab29f5ced583938901804ed8a93665f51b.600x338.jpg?t=1794866995","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599880/4da212ab29f5ced583938901804ed8a93665f51b/ss_4da212ab29f5ced583938901804ed8a93665f51b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794866995"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599880/863d20828b83e1ffbcc070552f1b59966eb3eece/ss_863d20828b83e1ffbcc070552f1b59966eb3eece.600x338.jpg?t=1794866995","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599880/863d20828b83e1ffbcc070552f1b59966eb3eece/ss_863d20828b83e1ffbcc070552f1b59966eb3eece.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794866995"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599880/c51e15129b48016e6242146ae65ef01b042684ed/ss_c51e15129b48016e6242146ae65ef01b042684ed.600x338.jpg?t=1794866995","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599880/c51e15129b48016e6242146ae65ef01b042684ed/ss_c51e15129b48016e6242146ae65ef01b042684ed.1920x